        "rationale": "The e2e workflow still runs when the `e2e` label is added (keyed on `github.event.label.name`) and on later pushes to a labeled PR, while `test` keeps opened, synchronize and reopened; the `if` relies on `&&` binding tighter than `||`, which holds in GitHub expressions."
      },
